{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "__ID__",
  "title": "越线提醒",
  "sub": "数值越过你设的线时提醒一次",
  "_note": "动态提醒 = 有 alert、task 里有 depends。到点先跑 depends 取数,再跑 then 判定,判定说「真」才发。",
  "_note_minEngine": "发布前把 manifest.minEngine 抬到当前引擎版本 —— numable check 的 G45 会直接告诉你现在是几。写低了的话,装在旧版应用上这条提醒只是不响,不报错。",
  "i18n": {
    "en-US": {
      "title": "Threshold alert",
      "sub": "Tells you once, when the value crosses the line you set",
      "message": { "title": "Now at ${cur}", "body": "It crossed your ${price}" },
      "form": { "dir": { "title": "Direction" }, "price": { "title": "Threshold" } }
    }
  },
  "params": { "dir": "below", "price": "" },
  "_note_form": "form 的键必须都在 params 里,多一个就过不了闸。只有 form.<键>.title 进 i18n 的可译槽;选项的 label 没有槽,会一直是基准语言 —— 真要分语言,就别给这个键写 form,或者把区别写进 title。",
  "form": {
    "dir": {
      "title": "方向",
      "component": {
        "type": "radio",
        "props": { "items": [{ "label": "跌破", "value": "below" }, { "label": "涨过", "value": "above" }] }
      }
    },
    "price": { "title": "价位", "required": true, "component": { "type": "numberInput" } }
  },
  "events": { "onClick": "numable://self" },
  "task": {
    "_note_depends": "把下面的 flow 换成本包已有的取数流(路径从包根算起)。它的 resultFilter.keys 里必须真的透出 cur 这个键 —— 透不出来,判定就拿不到值,这条提醒永远不响,而且一条错都不报。",
    "depends": [{ "flow": "@[file://xWidget/flow/CHANGE-ME.df]", "params": {} }],
    "_note_then": "判定段。入参纯显式:depends 取回的键与用户填的参数,都要在这里写进 params 才进得去。",
    "then": {
      "flow": "@[file://xJob/flow/__ID__.df]",
      "params": { "cur": "${cur}", "price": "${price}", "dir": "${dir}" }
    },
    "refresh": { "interval": ["1800"] }
  },
  "alert": {
    "_note": "省略 activeCondition 等于写 $[eq::(${hit},1)],读的就是判定段输出的 hit。",
    "message": { "title": "现价 ${cur}", "body": "已越过你设的 ${price}" }
  }
}
